!data/**/README.md

# Results: small artifacts are committed (see AGENTS.md); heavy arrays stay local
results/**/*.npy
results/**/*.npz
results/**/*.h5
results/**/*.pkl

# Scratch
scratch/
*.log

# OS
.DS_Store

# graphify output — fully reproducible from the corpus
graphify-out/
